docs/threat-model.md:1303:- **Mitigation:** CODEOWNERS + `git log --show-signature` review + key rotation policy + `canonical_edit_denied` audit event correlation.
docs/threat-model.md:1310:- **Mitigation:** OUT-OF-SCOPE per §Out-of-scope item 3 + 5. Framework pins host allowlist and asserts HTTPS-only.
