   772	      # in the signed verdict + `shasum -c` over the evidence set).
   773	      #
   774	      # PINNED ORDER (asserted structurally by the W1B* classes of
   775	      # test_release_workflow_asserts.py, WaveB5 pattern):
   776	      #   Verify tag GPG signature → Validate pair-rail verdict →
   777	      #   delta → ancestry.
